name nchairx
category Package
revision 60196
shortdesc Maths macros from chair X of Wurzburg University
longdesc This package was developed by members of the chair for
longdesc mathematical physics at the University of Wurzburg as a
longdesc collection of macros and predefined environments for quickly
longdesc creating nice mathematical documents. (Note concerning the
longdesc package name: the "n" stands for "new", the "X" is a roman 10.)
